{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0404_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "2eed577a28400d1ba4815cd3868006a9f2752bdb1671c2c67bb481d44c339b32", "ja": "えへへ、いたずら大成功～♪\n{$P$}さん、すごい驚いてましたね！", "zh": "嘿嘿，恶作剧大成功～♪\n{$P$}先生刚才吓了一大跳呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
