{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0404_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "9a9df52c0e04129e2114427a5e6e1af14fcb1993a60be5006e6943858c5961da", "ja": "えへへ、ごめんなさい。『いたずら妖精』って、設定\nなので、いたずらの練習をした方がいいかな～って。", "zh": "嘿嘿，对不起。因为设定上是“恶作剧妖精”，所以我想，是不是该练习一下恶作剧呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0404_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "7192fd9cfcd7ffc1e8460c283d11b139586712b8270d211323171f719a48cbc5", "ja": "というわけで、{$P$}さん！\n一緒にお菓子を食べて、おしゃべりしましょう～！", "zh": "所以说，{$P$}先生！\n一起吃点心，聊聊天吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0404_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1e3ad223dbc1283cec9de56e40b1bddd629a0312b894e135546db6749eb9bc96", "ja": "えっと……それもいたずらなのか？", "zh": "那个……这也算恶作剧吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0404_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "617ea490372a23f4430f9e9b8c323846009debfbe1e349f90e191601067fa698", "ja": "はい！　甘くておいしいお菓子を食べて、\n私と一緒にのんびりしちゃいましょ～♪", "zh": "好的！吃点甜甜的美味点心，和我一起悠闲地享受吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0404_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "6b4ff6e500f47175781213363133b06f8b44b73776a65043fdaec310177ec97b", "ja": "それが、{$P$}さんに\nお仕事をさせないようにするイタズラです♪", "zh": "这就是不让{$P$}先生工作的恶作剧哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0404_1010_p", "source_sha256": "732fa3b1e7fbbf3d4fdfbd94db7fd9990fa16776fffc46902d94a5f6ae9d00e7", "ja": "なるほど、魅力的なお誘いだな……。", "zh": "原来如此，还真是个诱人的邀请啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0404_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "93e1f6e9c2b8e7616251696a36b7cceeffeb18b17a2e3083fa8fd7ddff9d9a84", "ja": "ですよね、ですよね～？\nちょっとくらい、お菓子を食べてもいいですよね～？", "zh": "对吧，对吧～？\n稍微吃点零食也没关系吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0404_1012_p", "source_sha256": "cb95a99c49ce0d1b1b2e78338b868b41f8095cadb362d6f78d2e3794eb3e2e41", "ja": "そうだな、ちょっとくらい……って、危ない危ない。\n可奈のためにも、仕事を頑張らないと！", "zh": "是啊，稍微吃一点……不对不对，差点就放纵自己了。为了可奈，也得努力工作才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0404_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "9996b009d219cf3d6cb2a9b257424751c7d88f9a447e11328c2fb09283ac3733", "ja": "私のため……それなら仕方ないですね！\n可奈はとっても～、幸せ者～♪", "zh": "为了我……那就没办法了呢！\n可奈真是～幸福～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0404_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "7158b3edb6ac898eed2c23e96469e7334a89aec8c94d3fbcfd1fe31288f246c8", "ja": "って、ダメですよ～！　今日は\n{$P$}さんに遊んでほしいんです！", "zh": "不过，这样不行哦～！今天想和{$P$}先生一起玩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
