{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0404_1016_p", "source_sha256": "1b5e0250e1a727dc9ec9cbbe2b63d17f45a3289814414b9cc4563bdd370ce3fc", "ja": "遊びながら仕事……？", "zh": "边玩边工作……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0404_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "5705a8ae8f2744c2733653b82254aa41bc6180b781e1b8532733b9ad76b80e6c", "ja": "はい！　私と一緒に、いたずら妖精の歌を作るんです！\nそれなら楽しくお仕事できませんか？", "zh": "是的！要和我一起创作恶作剧妖精之歌！\n这样不就能开心地工作了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0404_1018_p", "source_sha256": "2df9826131dcd7399196b76770dff7e07c757e338d1731d1990c374dc64c56f0", "ja": "確かに、楽しそうだけど……。", "zh": "确实，听起来挺有趣的，不过……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0404_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "5c6e382db8814ca715063e732d93057a81bf7ba2aa43769a50ca77819e3a1e0c", "ja": "「可奈はいたずら大好き～♪　森の妖精さ～ん♪」\nはいっ、{$P$}さん、続きをどうぞ！", "zh": "“可奈最喜欢恶作剧～♪ 森林里的小精灵～♪”\n好啦，{$P$}先生，请接着唱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0404_1020_p", "source_sha256": "d7263c8a1293cdcd64aa5847c951f764709e100bb9a8f6cf0267321842a869c6", "ja": "もう始まってるのか！？　ええと……\n「歌って踊ろう……みんなで笑おう～」とか？", "zh": "已经开始了吗！？呃……\n“唱歌跳舞吧……大家一起欢笑～”之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0404_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "ab7ae19dfb202369de5b69253020aa3b77b7a0f9b33e9fc3e52da1427241f244", "ja": "わぁ、いい感じですね！　どんどん続けましょ～！\n「ハハッと笑えば～♪　みんなハッピ～♪」……。", "zh": "哇，感觉很棒呢！继续唱下去吧～！\n“哈哈大笑～♪　大家就都开心～♪”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
